G'Day,

	You will probably find the answers to all your questions in these two
places:
http://www.capgo.com/Resources/SoftwareDev/osk-newbie-guide.pdf
http://oskfordummies.hp.infoseek.co.jp/
	By the time you have read through these, you should have a fair idea
what you are doing.  MontaVista is not required, but if you wish to use
it (it is the easier way), then you will need to use RedHat.  There is
little point starting anything until you learn basic Unix, however; you
will not get very far without it.

	-- Matthew
